  "solution": "__**BODMAS RULE**__:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nWe check the each option:\n\n**Option (1)**: - and ×\n\nGiven equation: 25 - 15 ÷ 5 × 10 + 20 = 35\n\nAfter sign change, Equation is: 25 × 15 ÷ 5 - 10 + 20 = 35\n\n⇒ 25 × __**1**____**5 ÷ 5**__ - 10 + 20 = 35\n\n​⇒ __**25 × 3**__ - 10 + 20 = 35​\n\n​⇒ __**75 **__- 10 __**+ 20 **__= 35\n\n​⇒ 95 - 10 = 35\n\n**85 ≠ 35**\n\n**LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option (2)**: + and -\n\nGiven equation: 25 - 15 ÷ 5 × 10 + 20 = 35\n\nAfter sign change, Equation is: 25 + 15 ÷ 5 × 10 - 20 = 35\n\n⇒ 25 + __**15 ÷ 5**__ × 10 - 20 = 35\n\n⇒ 25 + __**3 × 10**__ -20 = 35\n\n⇒** 25 +30** - 20 = 35 \n\n⇒ 55 - 20 = 35\n\n**35 = 35**\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option (3)**: + and ÷\n\nGiven equation: 25 - 15 ÷ 5 × 10 + 20 = 35\n\nAfter sign change, Equation is: 25 - 15 + 5 × 10 ÷ 20 = 35\n\n⇒ 25 - 15 + 5 × __**10 **____**÷**____** 20**__ = 35\n\n⇒ 25 - 15 + __**5 × 0.5**__ = 35\n\n⇒ __**25**__ - 15 __**+ 2.5**__ = 35\n\n⇒** **__**27.5 - 15**__ = 35\n\n**12.5 ≠ 35**\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option (4)**: ÷ and × \n\nGiven equation: 25 - 15 ÷ 5 × 10 + 20 = 35\n\nAfter sign change, Equation is: 25 - 15 × 5 ÷ 10 + 20 = 35\n\n⇒ 25 - 15 ×__** 5 ÷ 10 **__+ 20 = 35\n\n⇒ 25 - __**15 **____**× 0.5**__ + 20 = 35\n\n⇒ __**25**__ - 7.5 __**+ 20**__ = 35\n\n⇒ 45 - 7.5 = 35 \n\n**37.5 = 35**\n\n**LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"+ and -\"**.\n\n84:T21",
